---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy: No Cookies - SocialSecurityTiming.com';
const description = 'SocialSecurityTiming.com sets no cookie, runs no analytics and keeps none of the birth year or benefit figures you enter in the claiming age calculator.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Overview</h2>
      <p>
        SocialSecurityTiming.com is committed to protecting your privacy. This privacy policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding your data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Data Collection</h2>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Calculator Data</h3>
      <p>
        All calculations are performed entirely in your web browser (client-side). The financial information you enter into our calculator - including PIA, AIME, birth year, life expectancy, and other inputs - is never transmitted to our servers, stored in any database, or shared with any third party. Your data stays on your device.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">No Analytics or Tracking</h3>
      <p>
        The site loads no audience measurement service and no tracker: no Google Analytics, no advertising network, no social media pixel, no session replay. Radif Partners, the publisher, does not count, profile or follow visitors, and records no personal data about the people who compare claiming at 62, 67 or 70 here.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        No page of SocialSecurityTiming.com sets a cookie, and the claiming-age calculator saves nothing on your device: your birth year, primary insurance amount, life expectancy and spouse details live only in the open tab and are gone when you close it. With nothing stored and nothing measured, there is no cookie banner to click through.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Hosting and Server Logs</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served by GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc., San Francisco). GitHub's servers automatically log technical request data, such as IP address, time, page requested and browser, to deliver pages and fend off abuse. We do not use these logs to identify anyone; GitHub keeps them under its own privacy statement.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Email</h3>
      <p>
        If you email <a href="mailto:contact@socialsecuritytiming.com" class="text-primary underline">contact@socialsecuritytiming.com</a>, your address and message are used only to answer you and deleted once the conversation is over.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        Since we do not collect or store personal financial data, there is no risk of your calculator inputs being exposed in a data breach. The website is served over HTTPS, so pages travel encrypted between GitHub's servers and your browser.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This website is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from children.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Since we keep no personal data from your visit, there is normally nothing to access, correct or delete; if you email us, you can ask us to delete that exchange. Residents of states with a consumer privacy law, such as California under the CCPA, keep all the rights that law grants; we do not sell or share personal information. Questions: <a href="mailto:contact@socialsecuritytiming.com" class="text-primary underline">contact@socialsecuritytiming.com</a>. You can also report privacy concerns to the Federal Trade Commission.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated revision date.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
